msgid ""
"Get support and chat with the Drupal community on <a "
"href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> or <a "
"href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a>. When you’re looking for a "
"solution to a problem, go to <a href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal "
"Support</a> or <a href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Answers on Stack "
"Exchange</a>."
msgstr ""
"Получете помощ и разговаряйте с "
"общността на Drupal в <a href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> "
"или <a href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a>. Когато "
"търсите решение на проблем, посетете <a "
"href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal Support</a> или <a "
"href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Answers в Stack Exchange</a>."

